## Cart Checklist — OpenCart Demo

### Preconditions
- [ ] Application is accessible
- [ ] User has at least one product added to the cart
- [ ] User is on the Shopping Cart page

---

### Cart Page UI
- [ ] Shopping Cart page opens successfully
- [ ] Page title is displayed correctly
- [ ] Product table is displayed
- [ ] Product image is displayed
- [ ] Product name is displayed
- [ ] Product price is displayed
- [ ] Quantity field is displayed
- [ ] Total price is displayed

---

### Cart Functionality
- [ ] User can change product quantity
- [ ] Cart updates total price after quantity change
- [ ] Update button works correctly
- [ ] User can remove product from cart
- [ ] Cart is empty after removing all products

---

### Navigation from Cart
- [ ] Continue Shopping button works
- [ ] Checkout button is displayed
- [ ] User can navigate back to product catalog

---

### Cart Persistence
- [ ] Cart content is preserved after page refresh
- [ ] Cart content remains after navigation to other pages

---

### Negative Scenarios (basic)
- [ ] Set product quantity to zero
- [ ] Enter invalid value in quantity field
- [ ] Proper error message or behavior is displayed
